{"id": "tesla-2026-05-09-032", "date": "2026-05-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": ["tesla"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Tesla postpones Model S/X Signature delivery event, leaving attendees holding the bag", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/Tesla-Model-SX-Last-Run-Signature-hero.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Tesla has postponed its highly anticipated Signature Edition delivery event that was scheduled for May 12 at the Fremont factory. The company sent a brief email to attendees today — just three days before the event — offering no explanation and no new date.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The last-minute postponement is leaving buyers who", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/05/09/tesla-postpones-model-s-x-signature-delivery-event/", "type": "rss"}]}
